88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-10-11T00:40:25Z","updated_at":"2026-01-30T15:23:09Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nOnly tested on Godot v4.5-stable_windows_arm64. I have not tested other versions.\n\n### System information\n\nOS: Windows 11 on ARM  - CPU: Qualcomm Snapdragon 7c Gen 2) - GPU: Qualcomm Adreno 618\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe official Godot 4.5 stable build for Windows ARM64 crashes immediately on launch. The console window appears briefly and then closes. This happens with the default renderer (`Forward+`) and also when forcing the Compatibility (`opengl3`) and Mobile (`mobile`) renderers via the command line.\n\nThe issue seems to be a driver incompatibility with the Direct3D 12 rendering backend, which is used as a fallback for both Vulkan and OpenGL on this hardware.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Download `Godot_v4.5-stable_windows_arm64.exe`.\n2. Run the executable from PowerShell or CMD.\n3. The engine will attempt to start and then immediately close.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A (Not Applicable). The bug occurs when the engine starts, before any project can be created or opened. The steps to reproduce the crash are simply to run the executable on affected hardware.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111495/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111495/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}